<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tech Blog</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to Hamster World!</h1>
    </header>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="column">
            <h2>Hamster Facts</h2>
            <p>Discover interesting facts about cute hamsters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="column">
            <h2>Hamster Types</h2>
            <p>Learn about different types of hamsters.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="column">
            <h2>Hamster Care</h2>
            <p>Learn how to take care of your hamster.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="clearfix"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="column">Hamster Food</div>
            <div class="column">Hamster Habitat</div>
            <div class="column">Hamster Activities</div>
            <div class="clearfix"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="post">
            <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQGKRWGpWmpIBnO03h-S646a8Lt9oDTd97BNH-bPiAwvQ&s=10" alt="Hamster" class="hamster-image">
            <p>This is an example of a cute hamster.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
